        {
          "path": "_m/g/c/3/n/inishmore-wp/football-field-with-haycocks-g.jpg",
          "filename": "Football field with haycocks - geograph.org.uk - 1470954.jpg",
          "caption": "Football field with haycocks It is difficult to decide if the field is disused for sports, and a handy crop of hay, or whether cutting the hay is part of the management plan. The decrepit goalposts might be a clue. In the background, the escarpment rises to and beyond the road with its fringe of houses.",
